      "text": "Measured on Node: ~730 ms CPU per real ~50 s task, ~1 MiB per session, 111 MiB base.\nE2B tool call 150-450 ms and sandbox create 250-360 ms (network, same in Rust).\nTotal: prototype in 1-2 days, production-ready in 1-2 weeks.",
